supplier_tibber.description:
The known Tibber price includes market energy, supplier markup and VAT. Nord Pool supplies spot prices without VAT. These are not added again to the live price. When Nord Pool forecasts are selected, the VAT and markup below apply to those forecasts. Grid charges are configured separately.

Price source: {price_source}

Daily supplier cost source: {cost_source}

market_prices.description:
Select the native Nord Pool integration for market prices and forecasts, or leave it empty to continue without Nord Pool. Area and currency come from that integration; choose an area when it has several. VAT is reviewed under Electricity supplier.

Source: {source}

Bidding area: {area}

Currency: {currency}

Country from the bidding area: {country}

